      "message": "There are existing makeXXX(e.g. l.1364 ~ 1430) utils. Move to the same place ? Also it is not friendly to read if the functions is the same but the default value is different. You could either:\n1. let the function with more arguments call base function(less arguments). E.g.:\nmakeKey(arg1, arg2) {\n    return makeKey(arg1, arg2, arg3Default);\n}\n\nmakeKey(arg1, arg2) {\n    return makeKey(arg1, arg2Default, arg3);\n}\n\nmakeKey(arg1) {\n    return makeKey(arg1, arg2Default, arg3Default);\n}\n\nmakeKey(arg1, arg2, arg3) {\n    return new key(arg1, arg2, arg3)\n}\n\n2. Rename. E.g.:\nmakeKey(arg1) {\n    makeKeyWithArg2(arg1, arg2Default);\n}\n\nmakeKeyWithArg2(arg1, arg2) {\n    return new key(arg1, arg2, arg3Default)\n}\n\nmakeKeyWithArg3(arg1, arg3) {\n    return new key(arg1, arg2Default, arg3)\n}",
